Depends: systemd
Recommends: zenity | kdialog | libnotify-bin
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/tgayet/remote-shutdown
Description: Remote Shutdown agent - remote shutdown, popups and chat
 Agent of Remote Shutdown. It enrolls once with the master (one-time token and
 pinned CA fingerprint), then keeps a mutual-TLS connection open to receive
 shutdown orders with countdown, popup messages and chat messages, and reports
 its uptime and network interfaces. Static binary, no runtime dependency.
